---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Work With Me | LGBTQ+ Inclusion Consulting | Queerness Experiences" description={"LGBTQ+ inclusion consulting and speaking for hotels, tour operators, destinations, and group trip planners, from Santi Solis, a queer, trans Tulum local."}>

<section class="guide wwm-hero" id="work-with-me" style="border-top:none;position:relative;overflow:hidden;">
  <div class="shape-y"></div>
  <div class="shape-t"></div>
  <div class="guide-inner" style="position:relative;z-index:2;display:block;">
    <p class="sec-eye" style="color:var(--yellow);position:relative;z-index:2;">Work With Me</p>
    <h1>LGBTQ+ inclusion, from someone who lives it.</h1>
    <p class="guide-lead">I help hotels, tour operators, destinations, and group trip planners become places and trips LGBTQ+ and queer travelers actually trust, not through a generic training deck, but through the perspective of someone who is Mexican, queer, and based here in Tulum.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="offer">
  <div class="offer-inner">
    <p class="sec-eye" style="color:var(--yellow);">The offering</p>
    <h2>LGBTQ+ Inclusion<br><span class="accent">Consulting</span></h2>
    <p class="offer-lead">A collaborative walkthrough of your property or operation, covering how welcoming your booking process, staff training, signage, and guest experience actually are for LGBTQ+ travelers, with specific, practical recommendations you can act on.</p>
    <p class="offer-lead">I also speak on queer and trans travel and inclusive hospitality, most recently on a panel at IGLTA's conference.</p>
    <p class="offer-lead">Plan trips for a group, club, or organization? I can also build and host the trip in Tulum around your people.</p>
    <div class="offer-note">Pricing and scope depend on your property or group. Reach out below and let's talk.</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="creds" aria-label="Credentials" style="background:var(--bone);padding:var(--s-lg) var(--s-sm);">
  <div class="cred"><div class="cnum">01</div><div><div class="ct">Mexican, Tulum-Based</div><div class="cd">Not an outside consultant. I live in the community I'd be advising you on.</div></div></div>
  <div class="cred"><div class="cnum">02</div><div><div class="ct">UCLA Wildlife Biologist</div><div class="cd">Former field biologist, a science background most travel consultants don't have.</div></div></div>
  <div class="cred"><div class="cnum">03</div><div><div class="ct">IGLTA Conference Panelist</div><div class="cd">Invited by IGLTA to speak on a panel about creating queer experiences, at an event put together by the Guadalajara Tourism Board.</div></div></div>
</section>

<section class="start-now">
  <div class="start-now-inner">
    <div class="start-now-text">
      <p class="sec-eye" style="color:var(--dark);">Already have a queer group?</p>
      <h2>Groups of 3 or more<br>can plan a private<br>group trip now.</h2>
      <p>We'll build the itinerary around your group.</p>
      <div class="start-chips">
        <span class="start-chip">Group rates available</span>
        <span class="start-chip">Booking 3+ months ahead? Ask about an early-booking rate</span>
        <span class="start-chip">Open camp dates coming soon</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="start-now-cta">
      <a href="/bring-your-group" class="btn-groups">Plan a Group Trip →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="contact" id="contact">
  <p class="sec-eye">Let's talk</p>
  <h2>Tell me about<br>your work.</h2>
  <p class="contact-lead">A few lines about your hotel, tour company, destination, or group, and what you're hoping to work on. I'll reply personally.</p>
  <form class="form" name="work-with-me" method="POST" data-netlify="true" action="/thank-you">
    <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="work-with-me" />
    <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;">
      <div style="flex:1;"><label class="fl">First name</label><input class="fi" type="text" name="first-name" placeholder="First name" required></div>
      <div style="flex:1;"><label class="fl">Last name</label><input class="fi" type="text" name="last-name" placeholder="Last name" required></div>
    </div>
    <div><label class="fl">Email</label><input class="fi" type="email" name="email" placeholder="your@email.com" required></div>
    <div><label class="fl">Pronouns</label><input class="fi" type="text" name="pronouns"></div>
    <div><label class="fl">Company, property, or organization name</label><input class="fi" type="text" name="company" placeholder="Hotel, tour company, group, or organization" required></div>
    <div><label class="fl">What are you hoping to work on?</label><textarea class="fi" name="message" rows="4" placeholder="Inclusion consulting, speaking, a group trip, or something else" style="resize:vertical;font-family:var(--fb);" required></textarea></div>
    <button type="submit" class="fsub">Send</button>
  </form>
</section>

</Layout>

<style>
  .start-now{background:var(--yellow);border-top:3px solid var(--dark);border-bottom:3px solid var(--dark);padding:var(--s-md) var(--s-sm);}
  .start-now-inner{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--s-sm);}
  .start-now h2{font-family:var(--ff);font-size:28px;line-height:1.1;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dark);margin:0 0 var(--s-sm);}
  .start-now p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:var(--dark);max-width:560px;}
  .start-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:var(--s-sm);}
  .start-chip{background:var(--white);border:2px solid var(--dark);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 14px;font-family:var(--fb);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.3;color:var(--dark);}
  .start-now-cta{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;}
  .start-now-cta .btn-groups{display:inline-block;background:var(--dark);color:var(--white);border-color:var(--dark);box-shadow:5px 5px 0 var(--magenta);}
  @media(min-width:720px){.start-now{padding:var(--s-lg) 40px;}.start-now h2{font-size:44px;}.start-now-inner{flex-direction:row;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:var(--s-lg);}.start-now-cta{flex-shrink:0;}}
  .wwm-hero h1{-webkit-text-stroke:1.5px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);paint-order:stroke fill;max-width:640px;position:relative;z-index:2;}
  .wwm-hero .guide-lead{position:relative;z-index:2;}
  .offer{padding:var(--s-lg) var(--s-sm);max-width:680px;margin:0 auto;}
  .offer-inner h2{font-family:var(--ff);font-size:34px;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1;margin-bottom:var(--s-sm);color:var(--dark);}
  .offer-inner .accent{color:var(--magenta);}
  .offer-lead{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--dark);margin-bottom:var(--s-sm);}
  .offer-note{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:var(--s-sm);font-style:italic;}
</style>
